"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4511920","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4413220-1846651706686846","game_id":"steam-4413220","kind":"update","title":"Multiplayer update 2","summary":"Combat feel update Punches lock on to the nearest opponent in front of you and step in to make contact. New punch animation and hit effect. Hits now have a short pause, a flinch, knockback, camera shake and rumble. Online, your punch starts the moment you press the button. Online and menus Friends who join a match in progress play their own character and items instead of taking over the bot. Rejoining a match you left keeps your loadout, and your items aren't used up again. Character select: Inv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T12:19:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686846","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4413220-1846018067932512","game_id":"steam-4413220","kind":"update","title":"Multiplayer patch 1","summary":"Online play The match list on Play Online now updates properly when you come back to it or press Refresh Match rows are centered and the selected match is fully outlined Play Online now shows your online rating Lobbies show the correct number of seats for 1v1 and 2v2 Fixed two players being able to grab the same last seat You can no longer join a rated match after it has started Quitting a rated match by closing the game now counts as a loss Matches The match clock stops exactly at 0:00 A shot i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T08:10:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932512","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4413220-1846018067926894","game_id":"steam-4413220","kind":"update","title":"Online Multiplayer Update","summary":"Play together onlineVersus Online: take on other players in 1v1 or 2v2 matches and climb the ratings.Co-op Endless: bring a Steam friend into your Endless run. They can jump in at any time, even mid-match.Your lobby, your rules: open it to everyone or keep it friends-only.Fresh new lookA rebuilt main menu with a new logo and a street-corner scene.One character select for every mode: compare stats and gear up before each match.Smoother gamepad controls in every menu.On the courtPower throws now s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T17:16:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926894","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4413220-1829528821310624","game_id":"steam-4413220","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.5.2","summary":"Demo progression now follows the regular flow of the first 10 matches, replacing the previous accelerated and skipped‑round format.Match modifier values adjusted to more accurately match their gameplay effects.Removed friendly fire from equipped items.Exhausted stamina mechanic rework.Improved clarity about orbs and their usage.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-10T16:13:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821310624","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4413220-1828894815559632","game_id":"steam-4413220","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.5.1","summary":"Reduced game size 25%Improved dunk animation and dunking logic (press and hold throw / attack when near basket)Increased power pickup valu